         <title>CCDASTRO Master Workflow 0.4.0</title>
         <description>
            <p>Launch-only session planning with PI 1.9.6 ImageAnalysis, BlindSolver, astrometric/lunar registration, mosaic calibration and WBPP log analysis choices. Five acquisition profiles and existing plans remain supported. Folder entries are a checklist, not automatic tool inputs. No processing runs automatically.</p>
